{"pageid":3716,"title":"Rare Nodes","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Rare Nodes</span>","revid":20922,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>(sorry for my bad english, im from mexico and i used google translator )</b> \n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 415px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/81/Moai_shaped_Tin_ore.png/revision/latest?cb=20241221020504\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Moai shaped Tin ore&#39;&quot;`UNIQ--gallery-00000000-QINU`&quot;&#39;\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/81/Moai_shaped_Tin_ore.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/415?cb=20241221020504\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"415\" height=\"233\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Moai shaped Tin ore.png\" data-image-key=\"Moai_shaped_Tin_ore.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Moai_shaped_Tin_ore.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Moai shaped Tin ore</p><div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"3e54905ee3685aabaffe111118efe615\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\">bytner1: tree shaped ink ore</div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:175px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Ink_ore_tree-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:173px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Ink_ore_tree.png\" title=\"Ink ore tree.png (425 KB)\" style=\"height:173px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.